B.aks=new A.df("security","Privacy & app lock","The app lock (a PIN of 4 digits, and the fingerprint where the phone has one) and how long Thara may stay in the background before asking again. A forgotten PIN is reset from the lock screen through the Thara account (password, Google or a code by email); nothing is erased.",B.bEJ)
B.baF=s(["Switch each kind on or off; Remind me at picks the hour."],t.s)
